13. Conclusion
This project demonstrated the application of machine learning classification techniques to loan approval prediction.

Logistic Regression provided the strongest overall predictive performance, while class weighting improved the identification of rejected applications.

The experiments also demonstrated that addressing class imbalance requires careful evaluation because oversampling does not automatically guarantee improved model performance.

